OL,3,GNEWSAMum died from aggressive cancer
OL,4,Aafter nine-month wait for test results
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum-of-three died from cancer
OL,7,Ffollowing a nine-month delay in
OL,8,Freceiving pathology test results,
OL,9,Fmeaning she did not receive potentially
OL,10,Flife-extending treatment fast enough,
OL,11,Fan inquest has heard.
OL,13,FSarah Catherine Daniels' husband said
OL,14,Fshe "never gave up" trying to fight her
OL,15,Frare and aggressive cancer, but died at
OL,16,Fhome in Porth, Rhondda Cynon Taf, aged
OL,17,F43 in April 2025.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
