OL,3,GNEWSAMum died from aggressive cancer
OL,4,Aafter nine-month wait for test results
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Rachel Knight said the
OL,7,Fpathology department where a mass from
OL,8,FSarah's ovary had been sent for testing
OL,9,Fwas at the time "completely overwhelmed
OL,10,Fby demand" following the Covid-19
OL,11,Fpandemic.
OL,13,FShe told the inquest at Pontypridd
OL,14,FCoroners' Court that the delay was
OL,15,F"unacceptable" and reduced the chance
OL,16,Fof successful chemotherapy.
